{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-lime-10-going-further","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[{"image":"ic_theme_intro.png","backgroundImage":"ic_theme_intro.png","kind":"hero","estimatedTimeInMinutes":10,"title":"Going further with more resources","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Since you have learned how OUDS works with theme, themeable view, components, tuning and view modifiers, it is time now to discover some online resources.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"chapter":"Go further with more ressources"},{"kind":"tasks","tasks":[{"contentSection":[{"kind":"contentAndMedia","mediaPosition":"trailing","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Xcode can use the Swift DocC documentation of OUDS, and this documentation is used to build a static web site."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"But there are also other resources which can be useful for you.","type":"text"}]}]}],"anchor":"More-resources","title":"More resources","stepsSection":[{"type":"step","code":null,"runtimePreview":null,"media":"tutorial-lime-10-1.png","caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You can get it at ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}]}],"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The iOS technical documentation is available online. It has been generated from all the Swift DocC documentation written in the Swift Package.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"You will find several catalogs (as many as libraries) with details about everything: components, tokens, themes, providers, etc.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The whole design system is documented and available online. You can find everything about components, tokens, guidelines and principles of OUDS."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"icon finder"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is also available there to get icons for your projects."}]}],"type":"step","runtimePreview":null,"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Go to the website and learn things at ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/unified-design-system.orange.com\/"}]}],"media":"tutorial-lime-10-2.png","code":null},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS iOS provides also a wiki attached to its GitHub repository. The wiki is a public base of knowledge with plenty of things: available API, technical architecture, tips about processes, tests, conventions and toolings.","type":"text"}]}],"media":"tutorial-lime-10-3.png","code":null,"runtimePreview":null,"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Have a look "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/wiki"},{"type":"text","text":" to discover how OUDS works."}]}],"type":"step"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For technical reasons the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios","type":"reference"},{"text":" GitHub repository does not embed the source code of the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"design system toolbox"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" app. In fact this app and all its snapshots for tests increases a lot the size of the repository.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"media":"tutorial-lime-10-4.png","code":null,"runtimePreview":null,"caption":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To get the source code of this showcase app, go to its dedicated GitHub repository at ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios-design-system-toolbox","type":"reference"}],"type":"paragra